{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "02b46311bcaf546c62ccbaf605758d63b682cbfc03107796658e0de2c751fcec", "ja": "友達と姉妹", "zh": "朋友与姐妹", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7c1316aa1c431f24c0bcf70e9b94ed64f0215cfa3960f71e539c9467a73d53e2", "ja": "紬と仲良くなる作戦を考える桃子とクラスメ\nイト達。だが作戦がばれ、口論の結果、紬は\n倒れてしまう。悩む桃子は救いを求めるよう\nに温室へと向かうが、そこで美奈子と恵美が\n姉妹を解消するという話を聞いてしまう。", "zh": "桃子和同学们想出了和紬拉近关系的计划。然而计划被发现后，争吵之中紬倒下了。烦恼不已的桃子像是寻求救助般前往温室，却在那里听到了美奈子和惠美要解除姐妹关系的消息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "85b0e3cb85eb7415a14fe792dbafa47eb5861278a82850fe6b1c082dccf5ed04", "ja": "はぁ……やっぱり、もう噂になってるみたいですね。\nデラシネなんて、みんな面白がっちゃって。", "zh": "唉……果然已经传开了啊。\n大家都把“无根之人”当成有趣的谈资了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "8cdf37a0b4baf9406ffc93f812c56f6d8c52fa81a07bb60efb8c4234e6952300", "ja": "学園の七不思議みたいに言われてますけど、\n本当はそんな、珍しい事じゃないのに。", "zh": "虽然被人传得像是校园七大不可思议一样，\n但其实根本就不是什么稀奇的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a6b5535d061cbb57287ce5e8a12f24646efc6f4dc102a155c8cb923d27d32085", "ja": "そんなふうに言われてしまって、紬さんが\n傷付いていないといいんですけど……。", "zh": "被那样说了，希望紬小姐没有因此受到伤害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "8ac1d7db945602de8e7a267e71236c6442b2f1d18151278caf61394cf094cf5b", "ja": "もう学園中、デラシネの話題でもちきりね。\nたしかに珍しいし、ちょっとカッコイイけど……。", "zh": "整个学园里，大家都在热烈议论着无根草呢。\n虽然确实挺少见的，也有点帅气就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "c5776f4d6d45777cb7ff7b66f017df4ad91d2b25c6c2eedc9c533b32b5e57a35", "ja": "でも病気で休学されていなかったら、きっと紬さんにも\n姉妹がいらしたんですよね。何だかお気の毒です。", "zh": "不过，如果不是因为生病而休学，紬小姐肯定也会有姐妹吧。总觉得……真让人心疼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "2d2093e3a10496a1130ab4011ac85c95eae0720791b15e8ed933344d0c8991d7", "ja": "う……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "fc419f213e1d9da5c89a67fceccc45d4dd2180bed787b5487bb5bbecb9c600ca", "ja": "それより、このみさん。\n私が頼んでおいた例のアレ、調べてきてくれた？", "zh": "比起那个，这美小姐。\n我拜托你调查的那件事，查得怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "a28cd15bc9620eaf059e3b98a19124174bdb7ce3e3183135aacdadc9a9b52740", "ja": "ええ。言われたとおり、紬さんのパーソナルデータを\nひととおり調査してきたわ。……これ、どうするの？", "zh": "嗯。我按照你的要求，把紬小姐的个人资料大致调查了一遍。……这个要怎么处理？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "c25e00921b8719932481d68526d5562b16b51dcd063fef773f43aa33222e5619", "ja": "もちろん、みんなで紬さんのことを知って、\n友達になろう！っていう作戦だよ。", "zh": "当然是大家一起来了解紬的事，\n成为好朋友！——这么个作战啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "1d64121cfe4549f7d5fdbc4f99565dba08a8bc2423dd4b828457c2eb2e9c7b77", "ja": "それに、2年生や3年生にも友達ができたら、\n紬さんにもお姉さまができるかもしれないでしょ？", "zh": "而且，要是也能和2年级生、3年级生交上朋友，紬姐说不定也能有姐姐了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "49a2a5375e5f55c3a44e970d4aed73676a90aea81bd2799370511b562575589b", "ja": "けど紬さん、3年生のみなさんと同じ年ですよね？\nお姉さまというのも、何だか違うような……。", "zh": "不过，紬小姐和3年级的各位是同岁吧？叫她们姐姐大人什么的，总觉得也有点不太对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "33502266fec9453d49e23f6d2b8fb74b59ea08aeb131e0fd4f3702b7276854d1", "ja": "そうよねえ。それに紬さん自身が、\nだいぶ姉妹関係に否定的みたいだし……あっ！", "zh": "是啊。而且看起来，紬本人好像也相当反对姐妹关系……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "10b5cfe5b30698ed881a8072c95d7f95a988427e27130d91ffe418ba1179a00f", "ja": "え？　……あっ！", "zh": "咦？……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1e7a238554f87a79a9ab8c4527011f4926fd50d89b210105d7394175978fa386", "ja": "失礼ですが、そこをどいていただけますか？\n私の鞄が取れないので。", "zh": "不好意思，能请您从那里让开吗？\n这样我拿不到我的包。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c787e3a1cba37fd2b97b3f88ce9dddf86203b852df19b3be14d1ee182af20bc5", "ja": "それと……そのお粗末な作戦とやらも、\nやめてください。余計なお世話です。", "zh": "还有……请也停止你们那拙劣的作战计划。多管闲事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "603ab7ccd0b1606433c8b5b01e63e9a4836609d4eeae297d8c6b72539a150c45", "ja": "ちょっと、そんな言い方することないじゃない！\nみんな、紬さんのためにいろいろ考えたのに……。", "zh": "等等，你没必要这么说吧！\n大家明明都是为了紬小姐，想了各种办法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f1a71411ec74d1cf48acfecd75e71d2e233013402e5886ae0ad5f64a2205613f", "ja": "誰がいつ、そんな事をしてほしいと頼みましたか？\nはっきり言って、余計なお世話です！", "zh": "是谁、在什么时候请求过您这样做？说白了，这是多管闲事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "9aa6b9ed18c4df03bc7ff2acb4302d9863efa1bd66d2dabca5225c7f7ebe3221", "ja": "あのね、あなたがそうやって和を乱す態度を\nとるから……？　ち、ちょっと、どうしたの？", "zh": "我说啊，就是因为你总是摆出这种破坏和谐的态度……？等、等等，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cf08f59d3f104b0fb344cb905853f16065d3d90cab1d8fd6815493ebfad8e665", "ja": "っ……く、うぅ……。\nはぁ、はぁ……。", "zh": "呃……唔、呜呜……。\n哈啊，哈啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "0b0c0850a582ba3f2a8149b15f0a6dd1eb8f7ed6596cd4a9113ef8e37d7374fe", "ja": "紬さん、大丈夫！？\n大変……！　誰か、シスターを呼んできて！", "zh": "紬小姐，没事吧！？糟糕……快去把修女叫来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1022_null", "source_sha256": "4a522f1f825ca91d08a88bf6017d3673404e48de0fcb61fd99ea8d83514f481b", "ja": "デラシネの君が、教室で倒れられたとか……。\nけど、大事には至らなかったそうですわ。", "zh": "听说无根之人你在教室里晕倒了……不过，听说并没有酿成严重的后果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1023_null", "source_sha256": "f071e404e9a8124683739a26c47f186cf7924194fe6a798925b0d86f9fb6414d", "ja": "姉妹もおらず、病気も思わしくない……この先、\n無事に学園生活を送れるのか、心配ですわね……。", "zh": "既没有姐妹，病情也不见好转……\n今后能否顺利度过学园生活，真是令人担心呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "a9600d38e3ae7c2f3857414a7dee18e82dd98eca89983fd6995474341784df9d", "ja": "あの時、私がもう少し優しくしていれば……でも、\n紬さんだって悪いのよ。みんなを悪く言ったりして……", "zh": "要是那个时候，我能再温柔一点的话……可是，\n紬同学也有不对啊。把大家都说得那么难听……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "8b271517e158c0500ab15be7aa85d4c94564dfac97468e3a8955be620a3be192", "ja": "どうすればいいのか、わからなくなっちゃった。\nお姉さまたち、いるかな……。", "zh": "不知道该怎么办才好了。\n姐姐们还在吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "53c0710075bddca0afa49bc0427ec588156e71ec923fb2f9060822db69b90a8c", "ja": "……でも、そうだね。みんなの言うとおりだと思う。", "zh": "……不过，你说得对。我觉得大家说得没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "1391d93159e99900159d8ce95aff55920581d973c740187cd87f896da7dc467c", "ja": "？　美奈子お姉さまと……あれは、恵美お姉さま？\nふたりで、何を話していらっしゃるのかしら……？", "zh": "？美奈子姐姐和……那是惠美姐姐吗？两个人在聊什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "365381eeb198b833ce3465e7be9866f1f3befd9dd9ea80c58828a0465d817a8a", "ja": "私は、ミス・アルメリアには相応しくない。\n……恵美ちゃん。私たち、姉妹を解消しましょう。", "zh": "我配不上“阿尔梅里亚小姐”。\n……惠美。我们解除姐妹关系吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0189_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0189_story_04_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "9358877ae5cd4decc109586c30bc15e6a97210b34da29ef4bac544f9985c24ba", "ja": "！！\n……っ！", "zh": "！！……呃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
